  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Heat the olive oil in the tandoor clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the grated ginger, minced garlic, Korean chili flakes, turmeric, and cumin. Cook until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped scallions and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the ssamjang, salt, and black pepper. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped taro root and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the clay pot to the oven and cook for 35 minutes.",
    "Top the gratin with crushed pita bread and bake for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Remove from the oven and top with Greek yogurt, chopped cilantro, and a squeeze of lemon juice.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
